Package: QPATutorialsCourse
Type: Package
Title: Graded Tutorials for Quantitative Political Analysis
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("Suzanna", "Linn", email = "sld8@psu.edu",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Graded learnr tutorials with learnrhash submission for
    PLSC 309H: Quantitative Political Analysis at Penn State University.
    Tutorials cover R basics, levels of measurement, univariate and
    bivariate description, statistical inference, linear regression,
    and logistic regression.
